            <title>0.7.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:18:52 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>151</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### New
- **When did the agent last reply?** The info strip under the task header now shows the time of the last reply: "14:30" today, "Fri 14:30" this week, the date for older ones. Hover it for the full date.
- In the chat view, each finished "Worked for" line ends with the time the run ended. Hover a message for its full date and time.
- Hover the "8m" or "17h" in the sidebar and the list view to see the exact date and time.

### Changed
- **Thin scroll bars everywhere.** PiBoard now always uses the thin scroll bars that appear while scrolling, whatever the macOS "Show scroll bars" setting, so they no longer take space from board columns, Settings and sheets. Takes effect after restarting the app.
]]></description>
